<title>ESTONIA: FARM PRICES TO GO ELECTRONIC-AGENCY.</title>
<headline>FARM PRICES TO GO ELECTRONIC-AGENCY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for agricultural produce will soon be available on the net via the Estonian Agriculture Exchange, domestic news agency ETA said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said that the the exchange would start operation at www.the-exchange from the end of June and farmers will be able to find the price, supply, quantity and quality of farm produce on the net.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
